ype":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":-300000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Keepsake wardens are enamored by valuable grave goods and draw power from these simple treasures. A keepsake warden can spend 10 minutes concentrating on an item of light or negligible Bulk to designate it as a keepsake item. A keepsake warden can designate up to three such keepsake items, which it can carry on its person or leave elsewhere. The supernatural connection between a keepsake warden and its keepsake items is severed only when a keepsake item is broken or destroyed. Scrying and similar spells cast on a keepsake warden allow the caster to also simultaneously spy on the warden's keepsake items.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["occult"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"0fvF6rINGYuDXDSt","name":"Greatpick","type":"weapon","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/greatpick.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>This pick has a longer handle and broader head than a regular pick. It is too heavy to wield in one hand.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"greatpick","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fatal-d12"],"rarity":"common"},"p